{"id":"6c37c07068c18aeb","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support.md","title":"双折叠函数只在奇数阶有傅里叶支持","display":"lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support — 双折叠函数只在奇数阶有傅里叶支持","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support","aliases":["28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support"],"display":"lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support — 双折叠函数只在奇数阶有傅里叶支持","depends_on":["[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]","[[28-df-fourier-transform]]"],"source_book_location":"Lemma 22.27","source_printed_pages":"482","source_pdf_pages":"508","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support — 双折叠函数只在奇数阶有傅里叶支持"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fe673ed82ddf4ff\" href=\"?note=5fe673ed82ddf4ff\" title=\"28-df-bifolded-boolean-function\">28-df-bifolded-boolean-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcbf14393ebfa830\" href=\"?note=fcbf14393ebfa830\" title=\"28-df-fourier-transform\">28-df-fourier-transform</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Lemma 22.27"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"482"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"508"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{-1,1\\}^W\\to\\{-1,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{-1,1\\}^W\\to\\{-1,1\\}\\)</span>，假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bifolded}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{Bifolded}(f)\\)</span>，其定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fe673ed82ddf4ff\" href=\"?note=5fe673ed82ddf4ff\" title=\"28-df-bifolded-boolean-function\">28-df-bifolded-boolean-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat f(S)\">\\(\\widehat f(S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_S\">\\(\\chi_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fcbf14393ebfa830\" href=\"?note=fcbf14393ebfa830\" title=\"28-df-fourier-transform\">28-df-fourier-transform</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[W]\">\\(S\\subseteq[W]\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat f(S)\\ne0\\Longrightarrow |S|\\equiv1\\pmod2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat f(S)\\ne0\\Longrightarrow |S|\\equiv1\\pmod2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：x↦−x 保持均匀测度，且 χ_S(−x)=(−1)^{|S|}χ_S(x)。双折叠给出 f(−x)=−f(x)，故若 |S| 偶数，则系数等于自身相反数，只能为零；空集也被排除。已复核原书配对消去证明。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Lemma 22.27；印刷页 482；PDF 页 508。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-bifolded-boolean-function","status":"resolved","id":"5fe673ed82ddf4ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-fourier-transform","status":"resolved","id":"fcbf14393ebfa830","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-fourier-transform]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-bifolded-boolean-function","status":"resolved","id":"5fe673ed82ddf4ff","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$f:\\{-1,1\\}^W\\to\\{-1,1\\}$，假定 $\\operatorname{Bifolded}(f)$，其定义见 [[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]；$\\widehat f(S)$、$\\chi_S$ 见 [[28-df-fourier-transform]]，$S\\subseteq[W]$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-fourier-transform","status":"resolved","id":"fcbf14393ebfa830","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$f:\\{-1,1\\}^W\\to\\{-1,1\\}$，假定 $\\operatorname{Bifolded}(f)$，其定义见 [[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]；$\\widehat f(S)$、$\\chi_S$ 见 [[28-df-fourier-transform]]，$S\\subseteq[W]$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"W\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{-1,1\\}^W\\to\\{-1,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bifolded}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat f(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_S","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[W]","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat f(S)\\ne0\\Longrightarrow |S|\\equiv1\\pmod2.","display":true}],"bytes":1431,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-404","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]、[[28-df-cl-reduction]]、[[28-df-constraint-graph]]、[[28-df-projection-game]]、[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-df-long-code]]、[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]、[[28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support]]、[[28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test]]、[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]、[[28-lem-n